Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:14.46,Narrator,,0,0,0,,An ancient, crumbling document lets the present know about an old anecdote.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:22.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It talks about the existence of a huge stone believed to be the root of Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.66,0:00:36.54,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}The setting of the adventure revolving around Mega Evolution...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:39.34,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}...now shifts to the Houen region.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:54.37,MegaTitle,,0,0,0,,{\fs25\fad(2112,182)\pos(630,540)}The Strongest Mega Evolution ~Act II~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:02.62,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry! This way, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:06.62,Manon,,0,0,0,,I'm fine! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:14.84,Alan,,0,0,0,,It's around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.81,0:01:22.65,Warning,,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,476)\pos(640,40)}While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.38,0:01:21.80,Alan,,0,0,0,,Manon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:23.26,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.26,0:01:27.80,Manon,,0,0,0,,My butt is stuck! I can't get my butt out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:30.41,Manon,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:33.24,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:34.04,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:44.68,ExtraType,,0,0,0,,{\fs37\fad(564,526)\pos(612,536)}Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY data broadcast!\NPress the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.42,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:40.72,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}My name is Manon. I've come from the Kalos region.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:42.36,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.36,0:01:45.72,Daigo,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs41}Oh wow... Welcome to the faraway Houen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.38,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'm Daigo. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.74,0:01:49.52,Manon,,0,0,0,,Daigo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:52.18,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Though why have you come to such a remote place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.60,0:01:53.86,Manon,,0,0,0,,Uhm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:57.32,Alan,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Manon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.32,0:01:59.84,Manon,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Daigo-san helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.88,Manon,,0,0,0,,This is my travelmate Alan and my partner Hari-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.22,0:02:03.84,Alan,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:08.15,Alan,,0,0,0,,A Key Stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.32,0:02:10.36,Daigo,,0,0,0,,You have one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:12.46,Alan,,0,0,0,,Will you battle me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:16.38,Daigo,,0,0,0,,It might not look like it, but I'm quite busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:17.80,Alan,,0,0,0,,It won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:21.83,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'll defeat all Mega Evolutions and stand at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.62,0:02:26.36,Alan,,0,0,0,,If you're a Pokémon Trainer, you know that eye contact is the cue for a battle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:28.32,Daigo,,0,0,0,,You've got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:31.55,Alan,,0,0,0,,Manon, step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:32.24,Manon,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:36.64,Alan,,0,0,0,,Go, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:42.74,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I see. A Lizardon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:45.60,Daigo,,0,0,0,,So then, here's my partner...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:46.94,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Metagross!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.62,Alan,,0,0,0,,So Metagross can mega evolve too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:58.40,Manon,,0,0,0,,It's an alternate-colored Metagross, Hari-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:03.70,Manon,,0,0,0,,But aren't Steel types weak against Fire types?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:06.44,Alan,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:08.16,Alan,,0,0,0,,Respond to my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:09.24,Alan,,0,0,0,,Key Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:11.34,Alan,,0,0,0,,Surpass evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:13.40,Alan,,0,0,0,,Mega Evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.14,0:03:42.96,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.02,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Psychic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:05.28,Daigo,,0,0,0,,The sparkle of the stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:06.42,Daigo,,0,0,0,,...shall be our bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:13.49,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Metagross,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:15.64,Daigo,,0,0,0,,mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:33.32,Manon,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:36.66,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Flash Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:55.99,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Flash Cannon's secondary effect has lowered Lizardon's stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:58.49,Alan,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'll defeat it before it defeats us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:04:59.96,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:11.67,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Meteor Mash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:22.54,Manon,,0,0,0,,It's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:28.40,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Mega Evolution allows Metagross's speed to dramatically increase.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:32.48,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Oh, not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:37.44,Alan,,0,0,0,,Take this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:38.94,Alan,,0,0,0,,Blast Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:51.90,Alan,,0,0,0,,It endured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:55.00,Manon,,0,0,0,,No way! And it was a direct hit, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:59.55,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Please don't underestimate my Metagross.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:01.34,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:05.00,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Meteor Mash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:22.08,Manon,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:24.74,Daigo,,0,0,0,,A Kaenjishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:26.16,Alan,,0,0,0,,Could it be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.86,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Can you put the battle on hold for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:34.80,Alan,,0,0,0,,Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.98,0:06:38.44,Manon,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:51.58,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Please excuse my subordinate's rudeness,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:53.10,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:54.77,Alan,,0,0,0,,"Champion"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:07:00.24,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,This is Daigo-san, the Champion of the Houen region's Pokémon League.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:02.72,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hari-san, that voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:06.20,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but you are...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.02,0:07:08.79,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for not introducing myself earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:14.17,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,My name is Fleur-de-lis; I represent the Fleur-de-lis Labs in the Kalos region.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:21.84,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I'm having him investigate Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:22.66,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Investigate...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:23.55,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.06,Manon,,0,0,0,,Are you the one who called Alan from time to time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:27.76,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:28.56,Alan,,0,0,0,,Manon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.94,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Who is this girl, Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:38.36,Manon,,0,0,0,,I'm Manon! This is Hari-san, the most capable Pokémon in Kalos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:43.26,Manon,,0,0,0,,And see, me and Alan are currently doing extremely well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:46.98,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,That's quite a small girlfriend you got yourself there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:47.42,Alan,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:52.80,Manon,,0,0,0,,Non, non! I'm not his girlfriend. I just want to mega evolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:56.32,Alan,,0,0,0,,Again, it's the Pokémon that mega evolves, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:58.06,Manon,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:00.26,Alan,,0,0,0,,Never mind. Go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:01.91,Alan,,0,0,0,,I've got something important to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:05.52,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hmph! What's with you, treating me like a child all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:10.20,Manon,,0,0,0,,Non, non, non!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.56,Alan,,0,0,0,,Geez, you're always like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:13.72,Alan,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:17.58,Daigo,,0,0,0,,You said earlier that you were having him "investigate"...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.80,0:08:18.40,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:26.56,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,The truth is, at my Fleur-de-lis Labs, we focus on the energy emitted by Pokémon when they mega evolve and collect data on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:30.54,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Through the Mega Ring he is wearing, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.70,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,The energy from Mega Evolutions is immense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:37.02,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We're conducting research on whether it could be used for peaceful purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.28,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Peaceful purposes, you say...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:40.60,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,By the way, Champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:42.64,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,do you know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:45.84,Daigo,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:49.24,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Alan. Who's Fleur-de-lis-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:50.82,Alan,,0,0,0,,He's very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:52.60,Manon,,0,0,0,,More than Professor Platane, even?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:09:00.14,Alan,,0,0,0,,Look, Professor! Hitokage has evolved!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.02,Platane,,0,0,0,,Wow, congratulations, Alan, Lizardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:06.04,Alan,,0,0,0,,I don't have nothing but good news, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:10.18,Platane,,0,0,0,,You're referring to the Mega Evolution stone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.83,0:09:13.08,Alan,,0,0,0,,Yes. But I won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.58,Alan,,0,0,0,,I've gained information on some other ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:16.88,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'll go and have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:25.76,Alan,,0,0,0,,Nothing here either...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:28.18,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:32.98,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Is this what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:35.73,Alan,,0,0,0,,That's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:40.32,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,...a Denryunite. I've been looking for this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:46.36,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,If you really want it, you can claim it by winning a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.11,Alan,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Lizardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:10:00.20,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,If you want to fulfill your wish, become the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:17.20,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Pokémon discharge powerful energy upon mega evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:24.10,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,This power is immense and I'm conducting research on whether it could be used for peaceful purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:27.20,Alan,,0,0,0,,In that case, let Professor Platane assist you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.07,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:31.58,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,If he publishes the information, there will be people who want to use it for bad purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.14,0:10:34.04,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,One look at human history and you'll see it's inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:39.64,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We can't let such people sully the professor like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:41.14,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,He needs to be protected!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:45.22,Alan,,0,0,0,,Protect the professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:46.80,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,So I want to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:50.13,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Will you assist me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:53.62,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It's a Key Stone and a Lizardonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:56.85,Alan,,0,0,0,,Th-These...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:04.40,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,If you want to fulfill your wish, become the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:07.62,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan! Hey, Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.74,Manon,,0,0,0,,Fleur-de-lis-san is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:29.76,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(350,630)}Coming up next:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:24.83,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,630)\an1\fad(0,471)}Finally, {\i1}that{\i0} Pokémon appears...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:29.76,Commercialblue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,630)\an1\fad(440,0)}How will the greatest Mega battle go!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:24.08,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)}This program is brought to you by these sponsors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:40.41,Alan,,0,0,0,,Director, this place is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:41.75,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.47,0:11:48.37,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:52.76,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I've been traveling looking for various stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:57.51,Daigo,,0,0,0,,but ever since I came to know of the existence of Mega Evolution, I've been searching for its roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:11:58.79,Manon,,0,0,0,,What does "roots" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:11:59.67,Alan,,0,0,0,,It means "foundation".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:00.79,Manon,,0,0,0,,What does "foundation" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:03.11,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:05.29,Daigo,,0,0,0,,This is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:07.91,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I figured you had one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:10.09,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It's the wooden tablet referencing the legendary megalith...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:14.74,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,This is what lead us to come to this region as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.13,0:12:18.75,Manon,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:20.51,Daigo,,0,0,0,,No, it's different from mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:25.53,Daigo,,0,0,0,,The tablet was split into several pieces, each having differing contents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:27.19,Manon,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.61,0:12:29.75,Daigo,,0,0,0,,If we combine the pieces of information each of us has...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:31.97,Daigo,,0,0,0,,...we can come even closer to the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:35.43,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Looks like we ought to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:41.19,Daigo,,0,0,0,,According to this wooden tablet, the ancient people were in the possession of a legendary megalith.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:45.97,Daigo,,0,0,0,,The text has been deciphered as, "The path to the megalith begins with the gate."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:50.77,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Mine says, "The key to opening the gate is the glimmer of two stones."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:54.07,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,"When those stones come together, a new path will appear."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:55.77,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Key Stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:12:58.20,Daigo,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:12:59.23,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:02.59,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Please follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.13,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:11.95,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Yes... This is believed to be the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:13.97,Manon,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's so high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:15.97,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Alan, step over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:38.37,Manon,,0,0,0,,Whoa, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.12,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'm floored, Fleur-de-lis-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:45.61,Daigo,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't come, I would've been digging holes here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:47.62,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,No, I have to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:49.57,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Also, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.93,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Without you, this path wouldn't have been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.54,0:13:54.29,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:57.91,Manon,,0,0,0,,The {\i1}Champion{\i0} is grateful to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.91,0:13:58.97,Manon,,0,0,0,,Aren't you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:02.27,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.25,0:14:28.95,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Here it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:32.71,Daigo,,0,0,0,,The megalith must be somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:42.21,Daigo,,0,0,0,,"Hold different keys over the two altars."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:46.15,Daigo,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt; the megalith is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:48.85,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Alan, go to the other altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:49.49,Alan,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:53.91,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Hold your Key Stone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:30.87,Daigo,,0,0,0,,We've found the legendary megalith!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:34.15,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,The roots of Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.07,0:15:36.51,Alan,,0,0,0,,The Key Stone is reacting to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.09,0:15:37.65,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.41,0:15:41.13,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It's me. We've discovered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.73,0:15:44.73,Voice,,0,0,0,,We've already got a hold of your coordinates, Director. We'll be there shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:51.49,Manon,,0,0,0,,Non, non! Hari-san, it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:13.75,Daigo,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.05,0:16:15.98,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We will first analyze its components.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:17.77,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,After all, it's a valuable discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:26.89,Alan,,0,0,0,,The energy of this light has the same wavelength as a Mega Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:30.83,Alan,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but its calorific value surpasses that of a Mega Stone by a large margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.73,0:16:41.35,Daigo,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:47.37,Alan,,0,0,0,,Something's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:54.56,Alan,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.99,0:16:55.85,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Rayquaza?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:05.86,Scientist,,0,0,0,,Director, the inner pressure of the megalith is increasing more than we expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:42.01,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Rayquaza can mega evolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:42.99,Alan,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:47.24,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,But it's happening for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:04.27,Manon,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:08.41,Daigo,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:10.05,Alan,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Everyone, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:32.77,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Have we enraged Rayquaza?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:34.55,Alan,,0,0,0,,Step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:35.83,Manon,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:38.25,Alan,,0,0,0,,Go, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.53,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Metagross!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:49.03,Both,,0,0,0,,Mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:04.86,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:22.58,Alan,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:30.45,Manon,,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.91,0:19:34.33,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Catch it, Metagross!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:47.57,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that's Draco Meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:02.09,Alan,,0,0,0,,Manon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:06.59,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Is it trying to destroy this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.91,0:20:34.63,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:36.67,Alan,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:38.29,Alan,,0,0,0,,We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:40.89,Manon,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.95,0:20:42.29,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.23,0:20:43.89,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:46.67,Alan,,0,0,0,,It's nothing bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:49.23,Manon,,0,0,0,,You're lying! You looked like you were in big pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:50.25,Alan,,0,0,0,,Never mind. Where is the megalith?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.89,0:20:52.75,Daigo,,0,0,0,,It's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.13,0:20:57.23,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Are Rayquaza and the megalith related in some way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.03,0:21:07.15,Alan,,0,0,0,,Energy waves?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.61,0:21:11.87,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They've been detected on the coast of Kanazumi City, if only feebly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.67,0:21:16.82,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Their undulation and the undulation detected from the megalith match in form.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:18.21,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Kanazumi City?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.59,0:21:21.75,Alan,,0,0,0,,So will we be able to locate the disappeared megalith?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:23.55,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,The chances are high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.75,0:21:26.61,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We will follow it non-stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:30.75,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Alan... Please go to Kanazumi City to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.71,0:21:32.37,Alan,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:33.59,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.11,0:21:34.39,Alan,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.07,0:21:37.68,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'll arrange for someone to collect us immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:39.30,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Also, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.29,0:21:41.63,Alan,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.69,0:21:45.19,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Don't let the Champion out of your sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:50.85,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,His knowledge will prove to be of great help to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:52.79,Alan,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.89,0:21:59.93,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Humanity has an everlasting desire for knowledge about Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.83,0:22:02.62,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,In time, this desire may bring about...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:05.85,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,...great change for both people and Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.55,0:22:13.91,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Mega evolving Pokémon we do not yet know of,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:17.07,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I ask you to show yourselves before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.07,0:22:19.67,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We are waiting...